% Scenario: translate then draw. Path points are transformed through the
% CTM as they are added, so the stroke is Move(72,72) Line(144,72) in
% default user space, while currentpoint answers in the current space.
72 72 translate
0 0 moveto currentpoint exch = =
72 0 lineto stroke
showpage
